tyle=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivae<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivae\"> </a></td><td>IVAE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with additional extranodal extension, asymptomatic</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivb<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivb\"> </a></td><td>IVB</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with B symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivbe<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivbe\"> </a></td><td>IVBE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with additional extranodal extension and B symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ive<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ive\"> </a></td><td>IVE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with extranodal extension</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivx<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivx\"> </a></td><td>IVX</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs, symptoms unclear</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivxa<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivxa\"> </a></td><td>IVXA</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs, symptoms unclear, asymptomatic features</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivxae<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivxae\"> </a></td><td>IVXAE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with additional extranodal extension, symptoms unclear, asymptomatic features</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivxb<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivxb\"> </a></td><td>IVXB</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs, symptoms unclear, B symptom features</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivxbe<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivxbe\"> </a></td><td>IVXBE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with additional extranodal extension, symptoms unclear, B symptom features</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ann-arbor-ivxe<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ann-arbor-ivxe\"> </a></td><td>IVXE</td><td>Disseminated involvement of extralymphatic organs with extranodal extension, symptoms unclear</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">iss<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-iss\"> </a></td><td>International Staging System</td><td>Staging system for multiple myeloma based on serum beta-2 microglobulin and albumin levels.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  iss-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-iss-i\"> </a></td><td>ISS I</td><td>Beta-2 microglobulin &lt;3.5 mg/L and albumin ≥3.5 g/dL</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  iss-ii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-iss-ii\"> </a></td><td>ISS II</td><td>Not ISS I or ISS III</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  iss-iii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-iss-iii\"> </a></td><td>ISS III</td><td>Beta-2 microglobulin ≥5.5 mg/L</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">isswm<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-isswm\"> </a></td><td>International Scoring System for Waldenström's Macroglobulinemia</td><td>Prognostic scoring system for Waldenström's macroglobulinemia based on age, beta-2 microglobulin, and albumin levels.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  isswm-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-isswm-n\"> </a></td><td>ISSWM Niedrig</td><td>Low risk: age ≤65 years, beta-2 microglobulin ≤3 mg/L, albumin &gt;3.5 g/dL</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  isswm-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-isswm-i\"> </a></td><td>ISSWM Intermediär</td><td>Intermediate risk: one adverse factor</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  isswm-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-isswm-h\"> </a></td><td>ISSWM Hoch</td><td>High risk: age &gt;65 years or beta-2 microglobulin &gt;3 mg/L, or albumin ≤3.5 g/dL (≥2 factors)</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">who-grad<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-who-grad\"> </a></td><td>WHO Grade</td><td>World Health Organization grading system for central nervous system tumors based on histological features.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  who-grad-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-who-grad-i\"> </a></td><td>WHO Grad I</td><td>Well-differentiated, slow-growing, low proliferative potential</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  who-grad-ii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-who-grad-ii\"> </a></td><td>WHO Grad II</td><td>Moderately differentiated, infiltrative, low proliferative potential</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  who-grad-iii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-who-grad-iii\"> </a></td><td>WHO Grad III</td><td>Poorly differentiated, anaplastic, high proliferative potential</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  who-grad-iv<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-who-grad-iv\"> </a></td><td>WHO Grad IV</td><td>Poorly differentiated, high mitotic activity, necrosis, microvascular proliferation</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">formen<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-formen\"> </a></td><td>Formen</td><td>Classification of lymphoma forms distinguishing classical and variant presentations.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  formen-k<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-formen-k\"> </a></td><td>Klassisch</td><td>Classical form of lymphoma presentation</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  formen-v<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-formen-v\"> </a></td><td>Variante</td><td>Variant form of lymphoma presentation</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eln-klassifikation<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-klassifikation\"> </a></td><td>ELN-Klassifikation</td><td>European LeukemiaNet risk stratification for acute myeloid leukemia based on cytogenetic and molecular genetic abnormalities.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-g<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-g\"> </a></td><td>ELN Günstig</td><td>Favorable risk: good prognosis cytogenetic/molecular markers</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-i1<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-i1\"> </a></td><td>ELN Intermediär I</td><td>Intermediate risk I: intermediate prognosis markers</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-i2<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-i2\"> </a></td><td>ELN Intermediär II</td><td>Intermediate risk II: intermediate prognosis markers</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-u<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-u\"> </a></td><td>ELN Ungünstig</td><td>Unfavorable risk: poor prognosis cytogenetic/molecular markers</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-cp<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-cp\"> </a></td><td>ELN Chronische Phase</td><td>Chronic phase (CML context)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-ap<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-ap\"> </a></td><td>ELN Akzelierte Phase</td><td>Accelerated phase (CML context)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eln-bk<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eln-bk\"> </a></td><td>ELN Blastenkrise</td><td>Blast crisis phase (CML context)</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">durie-salmon-stadium<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-stadium\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon Stadium</td><td>Multiple myeloma staging system based on tumor burden and organ function.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-i\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon I</td><td>Low tumor burden: hemoglobin &gt;10 g/dL, calcium normal, no bone lesions</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-ia<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-ia\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IA</td><td>Low tumor burden with normal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-ib<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-ib\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IB</td><td>Low tumor burden with abnormal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-ii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-ii\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon II</td><td>Intermediate tumor burden: neither stage I nor III criteria</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-iia<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-iia\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IIA</td><td>Intermediate tumor burden with normal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-iib<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-iib\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IIB</td><td>Intermediate tumor burden with abnormal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-iii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-iii\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon III</td><td>High tumor burden: hemoglobin &lt;8.5 g/dL, calcium elevated, extensive bone lesions</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-iiia<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-iiia\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IIIA</td><td>High tumor burden with normal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  durie-salmon-iiib<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-durie-salmon-iiib\"> </a></td><td>Durie-Salmon IIIB</td><td>High tumor burden with abnormal renal function</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">bismuth<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth</td><td>Classification system for hilar cholangiocarcinoma based on the extent of biliary involvement and resectability.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-i\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth I</td><td>Tumor below confluence of left and right hepatic ducts</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-ii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-ii\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth II</td><td>Tumor reaching confluence but not involving secondary ducts</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-iii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-iii\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth III</td><td>Tumor involving confluence and either right or left secondary ducts</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-iiia<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-iiia\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth IIIA</td><td>Tumor involving confluence and right secondary ducts</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-iiib<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-iiib\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth IIIB</td><td>Tumor involving confluence and left secondary ducts</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  bismuth-iv<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-bismuth-iv\"> </a></td><td>Bismuth IV</td><td>Tumor involving confluence and both right and left secondary ducts</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">masaoka<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka</td><td>Staging system for thymomas based on invasiveness and extent of disease.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-i\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka I</td><td>Encapsulated tumor without invasion</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-ii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-ii\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka II</td><td>Invasion into surrounding fatty tissue or mediastinal pleura</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-iii<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-iii\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka III</td><td>Invasion into neighboring organs</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-iv<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-iv\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka IV</td><td>Pleural or pericardial dissemination</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-iva<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-iva\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka IVA</td><td>Pleural or pericardial implants</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  masaoka-ivb<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-masaoka-ivb\"> </a></td><td>Masaoka IVB</td><td>Lymphogenous or hematogenous metastasis</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">mitoserate-gist<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mitoserate-gist\"> </a></td><td>Mitoserate-GIST</td><td>Mitotic rate assessment for gastrointestinal stromal tumors.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mitoserate-gist-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mitoserate-gist-n\"> </a></td><td>Mitoserate-GIST Niedrig</td><td>Low mitotic rate: ≤5 mitoses per 50 HPF</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mitoserate-gist-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mitoserate-gist-h\"> </a></td><td>Mitoserate-GIST Hoch</td><td>High mitotic rate: &gt;5 mitoses per 50 HPF</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">p16<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-p16\"> </a></td><td>p16</td><td>p16 protein expression status assessment.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  p16-p<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-p16-p\"> </a></td><td>p16 Positiv</td><td>Positive p16 protein expression</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  p16-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-p16-n\"> </a></td><td>p16 Negativ</td><td>Negative p16 protein expression</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">eutos-score<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eutos-score\"> </a></td><td>EUTOS-Score</td><td>European Treatment and Outcome Study prognostic score for chronic myeloid leukemia.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eutos-score-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eutos-score-n\"> </a></td><td>EUTOS-Score Niedrigrisiko</td><td>Low risk EUTOS score: ≤87</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  eutos-score-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-eutos-score-h\"> </a></td><td>EUTOS-Score Hochrisiko</td><td>High risk EUTOS score: &gt;87</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">sanz-score<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-sanz-score\"> </a></td><td>Sanz-Score</td><td>Risk assessment score for acute promyelocytic leukemia.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  sanz-score-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-sanz-score-n\"> </a></td><td>Sanz-Score Niedrig</td><td>Low risk: WBC &lt;10x10⁹/L and platelets &gt;40x10⁹/L</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  sanz-score-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-sanz-score-i\"> </a></td><td>Sanz-Score Intermediär</td><td>Intermediate risk: WBC &lt;10x10⁹/L and platelets ≤40x10⁹/L</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  sanz-score-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-sanz-score-h\"> </a></td><td>Sanz-Score Hoch</td><td>High risk: WBC ≥10x10⁹/L</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ipi<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipi\"> </a></td><td>IPI</td><td>International Prognostic Index for aggressive non-Hodgkin lymphoma.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipi-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipi-n\"> </a></td><td>IPI Niedrig</td><td>Low risk: 0-1 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipi-ni<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipi-ni\"> </a></td><td>IPI Niedrig-Intermediär</td><td>Low-intermediate risk: 2 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipi-hi<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipi-hi\"> </a></td><td>IPI Hoch-Intermediär</td><td>High-intermediate risk: 3 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipi-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipi-h\"> </a></td><td>IPI Hoch</td><td>High risk: 4-5 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">flipi<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-flipi\"> </a></td><td>FLIPI</td><td>Follicular Lymphoma International Prognostic Index.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  flipi-l<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-flipi-l\"> </a></td><td>FLIPI Low risk</td><td>Low risk: 0-1 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  flipi-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-flipi-i\"> </a></td><td>FLIPI Intermediate risk</td><td>Intermediate risk: 2 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  flipi-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-flipi-h\"> </a></td><td>FLIPI High risk</td><td>High risk: ≥3 risk factors</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">mipi<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mipi\"> </a></td><td>MIPI</td><td>Mantle Cell Lymphoma International Prognostic Index.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mipi-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mipi-n\"> </a></td><td>MIPI Niedrig</td><td>Low risk MIPI score</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mipi-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mipi-i\"> </a></td><td>MIPI Intermediär</td><td>Intermediate risk MIPI score</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  mipi-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-mipi-h\"> </a></td><td>MIPI Hoch</td><td>High risk MIPI score</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">risikogruppen-ghsg<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-risikogruppen-ghsg\"> </a></td><td>Risikogruppen GHSG</td><td>German Hodgkin Study Group risk stratification.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  risikogruppen-ghsg-fr<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-risikogruppen-ghsg-fr\"> </a></td><td>GHSG Frühe</td><td>Early favorable risk group</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  risikogruppen-ghsg-i<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-risikogruppen-ghsg-i\"> </a></td><td>GHSG Intermediär</td><td>Intermediate risk group</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  risikogruppen-ghsg-fo<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-risikogruppen-ghsg-fo\"> </a></td><td>GHSG Fortgeschritten</td><td>Advanced risk group</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ipss<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipss\"> </a></td><td>IPSS</td><td>International Prognostic Scoring System for myelodysplastic syndromes.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipss-l<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipss-l\"> </a></td><td>IPSS Low</td><td>Low risk: score 0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipss-i1<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipss-i1\"> </a></td><td>IPSS Intermediate-I</td><td>Intermediate-1 risk: score 0.5-1.0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipss-i2<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipss-i2\"> </a></td><td>IPSS Intermediate-II</td><td>Intermediate-2 risk: score 1.5-2.0</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  ipss-h<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-ipss-h\"> </a></td><td>IPSS High risk</td><td>High risk: score ≥2.5</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">her2-neu<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-her2-neu\"> </a></td><td>HER2-neu</td><td>HER2-neu protein expression and gene amplification status.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  her2-neu-p<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-her2-neu-p\"> </a></td><td>HER2-neu Positiv</td><td>Positive HER2-neu status (IHC 3+ or FISH amplified)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">  her2-neu-n<a name=\"mii-cs-onko-weitere-klassifikationen-obds-her2-neu-n\"> </a></td><td>HER2-neu Negativ</td><td>Negative HER2-neu status (IHC 0-1+ or FISH not amplified)</td></tr></table></div>"
